@* Reset my session (F153): one press puts this browser back to a first visit, so the owner sees the site as a new
   visitor does, and the admin's key stays. *@

<section class="card-p admin-reset">
    <div>
        <strong>See it as a first visit</strong>
        <p>Ends every chat this browser had, forgets what it kept about the site, and reloads. The admin key stays.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" type="button" disabled="@_resetting" @onclick="ResetAsync">@(_resetting ? "Resetting…" : "Reset my session")</button>
</section>
